{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Laravel 12 Performance Monitor",
  "description": "Performance optimization and monitoring for Laravel 12 applications",
  "version": "2.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "app/Models/*.php",
      "app/Http/Controllers/*.php",
      "database/migrations/*.php",
      "routes/*.php"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Code has been modified that may impact performance. Please review Laravel 12 performance optimizations:\n\n1. **Eager Loading**: Ensure eager loading prevents N+1 queries\n2. **Database Indexing**: Check for proper indexing on queried columns\n3. **Query Caching**: Implement query caching where appropriate\n4. **Route Caching**: Use `php artisan route:cache` for production\n5. **Config Caching**: Use `php artisan config:cache` for production\n6. **View Caching**: Use `php artisan view:cache` for production\n7. **Autoloader Optimization**: Use `composer install --optimize-autoloader`\n8. **Queue Usage**: Use queues for heavy operations\n\nAnalyze the modified code for performance bottlenecks and suggest optimizations."
  }
}